## `data/psi_117.xlsx` — Generator Script

Since you can't paste binary xlsx in chat, run this **once** to generate the file:

```python
# generate_psi117.py — run once, then delete
import pandas as pd

data = {
    "Fuel": ["n-heptane","n-heptane","n-heptane","n-heptane",
             "n-dodecane","n-dodecane","n-dodecane","n-dodecane",
             "n-decane","n-decane"],
    "do (mm)": [0.5, 2.0, 3.91, 1.75, 4.0, 4.35, 2.8, 4.3, 4.03, 1.0],
    "P (atm)": [1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 0.5, 1.0, 2.75, 1.0, 0.5, 0.5, 1.0],
    "XO2": ["21%","21%","21%","14%","21%","21.6%","21%","21%","21%","21%"],
    "Data File": ["PROCI_2019_Stable_Cool","PROCI_2019_Stable_Cool",
                  "FLEX_ISS_Heptane_Air","ZGF_Heptane_LowO2",
                  "PROCI_C12_2019","FLEX_1268_C12_He",
                  "MST_2024_C12_Air","MST_2024_C12_LowP",
                  "FLEX_Decane_R377","CoolFlame_Decane_Air"],
    "Reference": [
        "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.proci.2018.05.151",
        "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.proci.2018.05.151",
        "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.proci.2018.09.015",
        "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.combustflame.1992.09.003",
        "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.proci.2018.09.015",
        "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.proci.2022.07.094",
        "https://doi.org/10.1007/s12217-024-10115-x",
        "https://doi.org/10.1007/s12217-024-10115-x",
        "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.combustflame.2014.03.012",
        "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.combustflame.2021.06.018",
    ],
}

df = pd.DataFrame(data)

# Add a ReadMe sheet
readme = pd.DataFrame({"Note": [
    "Data compiled from FLEX-ISS microgravity droplet combustion experiments.",
    "PSI-117 (DOI: 10.60555/gz0q-b577) CFD validation inputs.",
    "All values traceable to cited DOIs.",
]})

with pd.ExcelWriter("data/psi_117.xlsx", engine="openpyxl") as writer:
    df.to_excel(writer, sheet_name="PSI-117_Data", index=False)
    readme.to_excel(writer, sheet_name="ReadMe", index=False)

print("✅ data/psi_117.xlsx created successfully")   
